  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Local Production of Vaccines Readiness in Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The assignment is to provide technical assistance/consultancy and administrative support to the National Institute of Pharmaceutical Research and Development (NIPRD) and similar institutions in drafting a National plan/Road map for local manufacture of medical technologies including vaccines as well as undertaking a comprehensive documentation of relevant stakeholders in the value chain for local vaccine manufacturing. Technical capacities of selected relevant personnel in vaccine Research and Development will also be enhanced. It is a joint action under the Team Europe Initiative being supported by the European Union and Bulgaria government. The National Plan/Road map for local manufacture of vaccines is to enable NIPRD better advice government and other key stakeholders on necessary steps to supporting Nigeria in this area. The contractor shall under the supervision and guidance of NIPRD carry out this assignment.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
